      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140605_14065413_0532&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140605_14065413_0532.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140605_14070943_0533&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140605_14070943_0533.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: Lorin, To: Martin Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Latonia State College on June 6, 1919&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. Martin Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6/6&lt;br&gt;
Dear folks,&lt;br&gt;
Dropped in here for rest today. Fine weather. We will be at Morrisonville 1st. We ought to be at Pearl 4th. Hope all there are well. We are.&lt;br&gt;
Love to all,&lt;br&gt;
Lorin&lt;/p&gt;</description>
